            "sid": "1CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár kurkú /abén bir iimu/uu/ún, waawitá in slaqwarár aa'áy. Qoomaarihe Yoabu múk slaqwara guna geerahaár as yaamaá múk Amoni ngiwa hayohiya', nee gixsár Raba gari harweér. Ala waawutmo Daudi ina meét baraá Yerusalemu. Yoabu gixsár Raba gari i haratláy gari hhitín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi slamaangwduú Munguúín kudá' ta bay Milkomu guna ar tláy, gway gawaá sagós i dahaás. Slamaangwí iiloeemawo a kílo mibeeri tám nee kooán ar sahaábu. Baraá guruudae tlaa/anoó tlaxo gawíd i deer. Daudi tlaa/anoowí guri slamaangós ar parootuús. Inós baraá gixsarihe muruú yaariír guri haasaáng wa ar tláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós múk gixsarí guna ar tláy amór do'ós i alé, nay do'ós wa gadiyusiyé' ar musumeéno, nee kureemaá muqsla nee tsabu. Inós gixsadaá Amoni sleémeero gina adoorí laáq. Alhhe'eesaywo Daudi nee muu sleémeero tay kií/ Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
